---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import { adsEnabled } from '../config/ads';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Privacy policy"
  seoTitle="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.brand} handles data: calculations run in your browser and are not stored. Details on cookies, advertising and your choices.`}
  lede="Effective [Effective date]. This policy explains what data this website collects and how it is used."
>
  <h2>Calculations stay in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    The calculators run entirely in your web browser. The measurements you enter are not sent to our servers and are not
    stored by us. To make results shareable, your inputs are written into the page address (the URL). Anyone you send
    that link to can see those inputs.
  </p>

  <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
  <p>
    Like most websites, our hosting provider records standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type, pages
    requested and time of request) for security and reliability. [Name the hosting provider and log retention period.]
  </p>
  <p>[If you add analytics, name the provider, what it collects, and how to opt out.]</p>

  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    {adsEnabled ? 'This site shows' : 'This site may show'} ads served by Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including
    Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user’s prior visits to this website or other websites. Google’s use of
    advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on visits to this and other sites.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can opt out of personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google’s Ads
    Settings</a>, and learn more at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>. Visitors in the
    EEA, UK and Switzerland are asked for consent before personalised ads are shown. [Name your consent management
    platform.]
  </p>

  <h2>Contacting us</h2>
  <p>
    If you email us, we use your address and message only to reply. [State retention period.] Contact:
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR, UK GDPR or California law), you may have the right to access,
    correct or delete personal data we hold about you. [Add the rights and request process that apply to your
    business.]
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We will post any changes on this page and update the effective date above.</p>

  <p><i>[Have this policy reviewed by a qualified professional before launch.]</i></p>
</ContentPage>
